SUMMARY:Radical Joy\, Blue Wave Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy Club brings you the bes
 t stand up comedians from all over the country and this week with have a s
 pecial comedy showcase!!\n\nRadical Joy is the idea that expressing joy ca
 n be an active form of resistance and resilience in the face of oppression
 . This was on display all over the country as the blue tsunami took hold a
 nd flipped the country.\n\nLet's celebrate America's political defiance wi
 th a night of radical joy in The RAD\n\nages 18+\ndoors at 6:30pm\, show a
 t 7pm\nTickets $15
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/317346789/
