SUMMARY:Sapphic Book Club!  - September
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nOur book club read for November is *The 
 Safekeep* by Yael van der Wouden. **An exhilarating\, twisted tale of desi
 re\, suspicion\, and obsession between two women staying in the same house
  in the Dutch countryside during the summer of 1961—a powerful explorati
 on of the legacy of WWII and the darker parts of our collective past.**\n\
 nMysterious\, sophisticated\, sensual\, and infused with intrigue\, atmosp
 here\, and sex\, *The Safekeep* is a brilliantly plotted and provocative d
 ebut novel you won’t soon forget.\n\n[Read full synopsis here at The Sto
 ryGraph](https://app.thestorygraph.com/books/3e16c6c9-2e16-4da5-bbb7-c5a22
 212b5b2)\n\n***\\*\\*\\****\n\nWe'll meet at **Cultivated Cocktails** \\(o
 ff Charlotte Highway\\) \\|\\| Come early if you want some yummy food and 
 drinks\\!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/317156154/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261027T031433Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T031433Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
