SUMMARY:Queer Comedy Party: Fall Rooftop Edition
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nEvery Thursday Modelface Comedy Club bri
 ngs the best local and touring comedians to Asheville! This week we have a
  special Pride Month Show on the rooftop at Antidote!\nChemist Spirts welc
 omes top comedians for a night of laughs. Enjoy a stunning AVL sunset from
  the rooftop bar at Antidote while giggling and sipping a classic cocktail
 .\n\nThe Queer Comedy Party is a night celebrating many of the talented qu
 eer comedians in Asheville and all over the country. All the performers ar
 e queer identifying but the audience doesn't have to be.\nages 21+\n\ndoor
 s at 6:30pm\, show at 7pm\nTickets $15 advance\, $18 day of\n[https://www.
 eventbrite.com/.../queer-comedy-party-fall...](https://www.eventbrite.com/
 e/queer-comedy-party-fall-rooftop-edition-tickets-2000321589722?aff=oddtdt
 creator&fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAcGRvZgFicmlkETEzM3NtUWtJMlp6eHVKUTJBc3J0Y
 wZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHmZiL4GtjLJFCnuwk_FrdgbxCLAHL5H6tdiV1U_
